#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:5 d77847940b6b4162ad81a8a8951f605d
msgid "Radio Failsafe"
msgstr "遥控失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:7 a743519dedfc410e89a429210f5beeb8
msgid ""
"RC control is not enabled by default so items in this section would not "
"be applicable. See :ref:`Sub Defaults<sub-defaults>` section to enable."
msgstr "遥控控制默认未启用，因此本节内容可能不适用。请参阅 :ref:`Sub 默认设置<sub-defaults>` 章节以启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:9 0c2a1cf082894010be37ee22471c9065
msgid ""
"Sub supports several configurable failsafe options in cases where contact"
" between the Pilot's RC transmitter and the autopilot's receiver is lost."
"  This page explains this failsafe's setup and testing.  Note the \"Radio"
" failsafe\" was previously called \"Throttle failsafe\" because of the "
"way in which some receivers use the throttle channel to signal the loss "
"of contact."
msgstr ""
"Sub "
"在飞手遥控发射机与飞控接收机之间失去联系时，支持多种可配置的失控保护选项。本页说明此失控保护的设置和测试方法。注意，「无线电失控保护」以前称为「油门失控保护」，原因是某些接收机使用油门通道来发出失去联系的信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:13 421fbe88d18d4b0ba45c3c3d0f654ae0
msgid "Sub also supports other failsafes, see the :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`."
msgstr "水下机器人还支持其他失控保护，请参见 :ref:`failsafe-landing-page`。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:16 cb51d9f8d3c24e39b921e10fea37871f
msgid "When the failsafe will trigger"
msgstr "失控保护的触发条件"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:17 69e94e5c16f84227a498196ceb5c1427
msgid ""
"If enabled and set-up correctly the radio failsafe will trigger if any of"
" these conditions occur for more than :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT<RC_FS_TIMEOUT>`"
" seconds:"
msgstr "如果已启用并正确设置，当以下任一条件持续超过 :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT<RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` 秒时，无线电失控保护将触发："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:19 6003712c9c3f45019f1f64244f33f5a6
msgid "The pilot turns off the RC transmitter."
msgstr "飞手关闭遥控发射机。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:20 753b0efb5e64473399d236d1f298a71c
msgid "The vehicle travels outside of RC range and signal is lost."
msgstr "飞行器飞出RC信号范围导致信号丢失。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:21 0c18549dca0d4fec851db5baf3d0f3a9
msgid ""
"The pilot forces the throttle channel below "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` from the transmitter."
msgstr "飞手在遥控器上将油门通道强制拉低至 :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` 以下。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:22 aa019f08d8474c0499650d4e1dc7c792
msgid "The receiver loses power (unlikely)."
msgstr "接收机断电（较为罕见）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:23 c58c0dd98c92405ab74ba5818adba0d5
msgid "The wires connecting the receiver to the autopilot are broken (unlikely)."
msgstr "连接接收机与飞控的导线断裂（较为罕见）。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:27 d7f0d0432a6540b6be0cc93527ac91a2
msgid "What will happen"
msgstr "触发后的行为"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:28 1f9e240f91e74b27a53559b72253d9f4
msgid ""
"When a radio failsafe is triggered, the vehicle can be configured via "
"parameters to do nothing, warn the GCS, or switch mode to SURFACE."
msgstr "当遥控失控保护触发时，可通过参数将飞行器配置为：不执行任何操作、向地面站发出警告或切换至 SURFACE 模式上浮。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:30 a7148521ac7046219bf21b057180045a
msgid ""
"If the rc failsafe clears (i.e. transmitter and receiver regain contact) "
"the vehicle will remain in its failsafe mode. It will **not** "
"automatically return to the flight mode that was active before the "
"failsafe was triggered. If the pilot wished to re-take control he/she "
"would need to change the RC flight mode switch to another position."
msgstr ""
"若遥控失控保护解除（即发射机与接收机恢复联系），飞行器将保持在失控保护模式，**不会** "
"自动切换回失控保护触发前的飞行模式。若飞手希望重新取得控制权，需要将遥控飞行模式开关拨至另一位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:33 7f75f98f706e4205a4c5ccaca9515af8
msgid "Receiver Configuration"
msgstr "接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:34 c63139bc5c0c42e794610928dbc4fea9
msgid ""
"By default, most newly purchased receivers will simply not output pulses "
"if contact with the transmitter is lost. However, some older low end "
"receivers will be set-up to simply hold all channels at their last known "
"position.  This is not good because the autopilot has no way to know that"
" the Pilot has lost control of the vehicle.  Instead the receiver must be"
" set-up to signal to the autopilot it has lost contact and there are two "
"ways that it can do this (the method depends upon the receiver). Each "
"brand of Transmitter/Receiver is slightly different so please refer to "
"your transmitter's user manual to determine which method is available and"
" how to set it up."
msgstr "默认情况下，大多数新购接收机在与发射机失去联系时会直接停止输出脉冲。然而，部分较旧的低端接收机会被设置为保持所有通道在最后已知位置。这种方式不理想，因为飞控无法得知飞手已失去对飞行器的控制。接收机必须被配置为向飞控发送失去联系的信号，有两种方式可以实现（具体取决于接收机型号）。每个品牌的发射机/接收机略有不同，请参阅发射机用户手册以确定可用的方式及设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:37 a30ef565ffd94b8c92cde7c93959e9de
msgid "Receiver configuration for low-throttle method"
msgstr "低油门方式的接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:38 76334b13c03645fa9b8760ba3bc0a882
msgid ""
"The **\"Low-Throttle\" method** pulls the throttle channel (normally "
"channel 3) to a value below the bottom of its normal range (normally "
"below 1000us).  This method is used by Futaba systems and many older "
"systems.  Below is the setup method for a Futaba T7C Transmitter with "
"R617FS or TFR4-B receiver which uses the \"low throttle\" method."
msgstr ""
"**「低油门」方式** 将油门通道（通常为第 3 通道）拉低至其正常范围底部以下（通常低于 1000µs）。该方式被 Futaba "
"系统和许多旧系统采用。以下是使用「低油门」方式的 Futaba T7C 发射机配合 R617FS 或 TFR4-B 接收机的设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:43 d3ac6c60cc634deabd7ebf9857369c9f
msgid ""
"Many receivers allow for the failsafe positions to be set either by "
"simply pressing a button on the receiver, or directly from the "
"transmitter. In this case, the transmitter is temporarily adjusted to "
"output a throttle signal below the normal low idle position (for "
"example,if low idle is 1000us, then 990uS would be sent) setting this as "
"the failsafe value for the receiver, then adjusting low stick back to "
"normal idle position. This below throttle idle value is then set for "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`, as discussed below."
msgstr ""
"许多接收机允许通过按下接收机上的按钮或直接从发射机来设置失控保护位置。在这种情况下，临时将发射机调整为输出低于正常低怠速位置的油门信号（例如，若低怠速为"
" 1000µs，则发送 990µs），并将此值设置为接收机的失控保护值，然后将低摇杆调回正常怠速位置。此低于油门怠速的值随后设置为 "
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`，如下所述。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:46 6096fdbe0a424ad3a33d761490f9b9a1
msgid "Receiver configuration for No-Signal method"
msgstr "无信号方式的接收机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:47 6eebfad2ea3a43a4828dbcaac9df372a
msgid ""
"**\"No Signal\" method** - the receiver stops sending signals to the "
"autopilot.  This is the preferred method and is how most modern receivers"
" operate. Below is the setup method for a FlySky 9 channel transmitter "
"with FrSky D4R-II receiver which uses the \"No Signal\" method."
msgstr ""
"**「无信号」方式** — 接收机停止向飞控发送信号。这是首选方式，也是大多数现代接收机的工作方式。以下是使用「无信号」方式的 FlySky 9 "
"通道发射机配合 FrSky D4R-II 接收机的设置方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:53 1565353cb6e24a928d042c74faa5e563
msgid "Parameter Configuration"
msgstr "参数配置"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:54 5f5fd88b2f3d43a7bb81c9084504eedb
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` parameter can be set in the "
"Mission Planner full parameter list or full parameter tree, or can also "
"be set using the Mission Planner *failsafe options* dropdown in the "
"Initial Setup >> Mandatory Hardware >> Failsafe menu."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 参数可在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中设置，也可以通过 Mission Planner 的Initial Setup >> Mandatory "
"Hardware >> Failsafe菜单中的*失控保护选项*下拉菜单进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:56 9d3686515bd244b68914fe4496b65496
msgid "**Disabled** (Value 0) will disable the radio failsafe entirely."
msgstr "**禁用** （值 0）将完全禁用无线电失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:57 1e201d32931d4a04a0dccdef0930a376
msgid ""
"**Warn only, prevent arming** (Value 1) Send a GCS message and prevent "
"arming if unarmed."
msgstr "**仅警告，禁止解锁** （值 1）发送地面站消息，并在未解锁状态下禁止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:58 20c397e401e241ebb330f9358335454c
msgid "**Surface** (Value 2) change mode to SURFACE."
msgstr "**上浮** （值 2）切换至 SURFACE 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:60 3ff15ffd9bb7455581aa3281fc21be72
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>`  parameter can be set in the "
"Mission Planner full parameter list or full parameter tree, or can also "
"be set using the Mission Planner *FS PWM* value in the Initial Setup >> "
"Mandatory Hardware >> Failsafe menu. It should be set:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FS_THR_VALUE<FS_THR_VALUE>` 参数可在 Mission Planner "
"的完整参数列表或完整参数树中设置，也可通过 Mission Planner 初始设置 >> 必要硬件 >> 失控保护菜单中的 *FS PWM* "
"值进行设置。应将其设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:62 d2bc8d0a359c44a5a126fdd76e1c71f0
msgid ""
"At least 10 us higher than your Throttle Input Channel (usually 3) PWM "
"value when the throttle stick is fully down and the transmitter is "
"**off**"
msgstr "至少比发射机 **关闭** 时油门杆完全下压的油门输入通道（通常为 3）PWM 值高 10µs"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:63 1ea97488e8234570a3c89e2b963a1405
msgid ""
"At least 10 us lower than your Throttle Input Channel (usually 3) PWM "
"value when the throttle stick is fully down and the transmitter is **on**"
msgstr "至少比发射机 **开启** 时油门杆完全下压的油门输入通道（通常为 3）PWM 值低 10µs"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:64 eca9cf88ce07471db5dcba82a98392fc
msgid "Above 910 PWM"
msgstr "高于 910 PWM"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:67 0dfa4dcce93142b791ec45a822300208
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:68 95d6433d469e4707aa79ab96e534b0af
msgid ""
"You can check your failsafe by performing the following tests with the "
"autopilot connected to the Mission Planner either via a USB cable or "
"telemetry link. You can complete these tests without plugging in your "
"LiPo battery but if you do connect a battery you should first be sure if "
"the thrusters run, it will be safe."
msgstr ""
"可通过以下测试验证失控保护，飞控可通过 USB 线缆或数传链路连接至 Mission "
"Planner。可以在不插入锂聚合物电池的情况下完成这些测试，但若连接了电池，应首先确认推进器运转时是安全的。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:73 9db1e4777f3045b583578660e2bd081f
msgid ""
"**Test #1** : if using the \"Low-Throttle\" method, ensure the throttle "
"channel drops with loss of radio contact"
msgstr "**测试 #1**：若使用「低油门」方式，确认无线电联系丢失时油门通道下降"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:75 5a250657f4584148815f9f891d40af03
msgid "Ensure your RC transmitter is on and connected with the throttle all"
msgstr "确保遥控发射机已开启并连接，油门全程"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:76 3df7160a881b4cb8ad7d004e17b698c1
msgid "the way down and flight mode set to MANUAL."
msgstr "拉到最低，飞行模式设置为 MANUAL。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:77 6c86750091d34b8286d7f29d79235b00
msgid "The throttle (channel 3) PWM value should be approximately as in"
msgstr "油门（第 3 通道）PWM 值应大约如"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:78 6cda8f116a5f4f05af00c2f670aa6406
msgid ""
"first illustration below.  Its value may be higher or lower but it should"
" definitely be at least 10us higher than the value held in the FS PWM "
"field"
msgstr "下方第一张图所示。其值可能偏高或偏低，但必须至少比 FS PWM 字段中保存的值高 10µs"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:81 dbc48797680749c7aaf4477324bf3a5f
msgid "Turn the transmitter off and the throttle PWM value should drop to be"
msgstr "关闭发射机，油门 PWM 值应下降至"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:82 4b4c8cfa5bf04763952cb7e15c5845a8
msgid ""
"at least 10us below the FS PWM field value (as in the second illustration"
" below) below"
msgstr "低于 FS PWM 字段值至少 10µs（如下方第二张图所示）"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:88 d8cdc6e70e9c40cba4638cce6d65243b
msgid ""
"A GCS message noting the failure will occur and the mode switch to "
"SURFACE if that action has been selected with "
":ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>`."
msgstr ""
"地面站将收到故障通知消息，若已通过 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE<FS_THR_ENABLE>` 选择了该动作，模式将切换至 "
"SURFACE。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:90 ace1477dc402431399c360568cadd9d1
msgid "If disarmed, a pre-arm message will be sent and arming prevented."
msgstr "若处于解除解锁状态，将发送预解锁消息并禁止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:93 d057c4865b0742678c982941a985088e
msgid "**Test #2** : retaking control after the failsafe has cleared"
msgstr "**测试 #2**：失控保护解除后重新获取控制权"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:95 e3fe023d0bc345b69a82d70dab8790e0
msgid "Continuing on from test #1, turn your transmitter back on"
msgstr "在测试 #1 的基础上，重新开启发射机"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:96 b889dcb2c3ca4e97b1fd36f3842b96b6
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"While the flight mode is still SURFACE, the pre-arm warnings should "
"disappear(assuming nothing else is preventing arming) and a notice that "
"RC has been reacquired sent to the GCS."
msgstr "在飞行模式仍为 SURFACE 时，预解锁警告应消失（假设无其他阻止解锁的因素），并向地面站发送遥控已重新获取的通知。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:97 8565c28c918645179730ea5e8227cb37
msgid ""
"You should be able to arm the vechicle now and change modes via the RC "
"flight mode control channel."
msgstr "现在应能解锁飞行器并通过遥控飞行模式控制通道切换模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:99 4ad3925939834b30a187511eb5af5029
msgid "**Test #3** (optional) : removing power from the receiver"
msgstr "**测试 #3** （可选）：断开接收机电源"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:101 66cd1dc82c564ba4957fbd0f5ca2b55a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Switch to STABILIZE mode, arm your motors and keep your throttle above "
"zero."
msgstr "切换至 STABILIZE 模式，解锁推进器并保持油门高于零。"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:103 44975af896ef4ee4a1a257b34b25a707
msgid ""
"Carefully disconnect the power wires connecting the receiver to the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "小心断开连接接收机与飞控的电源线"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:105 8c262c77dca14fcd8e77799220b3d750
msgid "The autopilot should failsafe as described in Test #1"
msgstr "飞控应如测试 #1 所述触发失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/radio-failsafe.rst:107 52e7fbf14f454571b272eb5d6ce5ba31
msgid ""
"Unplug the autopilot so that it is powered down before reattaching the "
"receiver's power to assure the receiver is detected during autopilot "
"initialization."
msgstr "拔掉飞控电源使其断电，然后再重新连接接收机电源，以确保在飞控初始化时能检测到接收机。"

